  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b50c6574386ffb07b17d1e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摘香菇、赏红叶……呵呵呵……\r\n是轮到Hunter登场的时候了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86cc07ec2d64bc211483dab72b77eaab8a81d7a29207beabe81ecb57dcb670b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e53a885df2b0bc01401c41d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Christmas、Valentine，\r\n中间还有正月新年……\r\n日本的冬天充满Party，好愉快Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8951f2de1ac5426f7c3f66f4093560b32ef772054ab6925d897f38cdc7e8d2ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b847152a82c6b156a186294",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy morning☆\r\n今天也要打起精神，\r\n暖呼呼地度过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ec066be9c6dcc2b5a8456087b092f2742a29a4eb6b367439c5e99d7f22dd9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9816ddec3c7436b52da2c2ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯哼♪只要穿上这件衣服，\r\n就会感到很兴奋！用雀跃的心情\r\n去睡回笼觉吧～☆……不行吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fafc56d572dc69f08d4c2b20cd6d938a9fd3ecd4622fd9928351338efd01ed2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ef5bf8edee306ae9b006a75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "公园……顶楼……富士山……\r\n今天要在哪里吃午餐呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54d72cf857fcf55af9a0f732679089216ba80c0f0381ca03ef92a8bdf42a2f34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ea4e405ba54e6432d8f1f21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "What……！被发现了……\r\n我本来是打算要\r\n偷拍你的照片耶～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fbaa94747848a6aaa2a3087ef09fe240b8410f337bc2d78bb57a52dcbb0b92b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5048c70ce50b718c34bf3fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你接下来要工作吗？那晚一点……\r\n我就带小草亲自传授的！提神醒脑☆\r\n苦苦抹茶去慰劳你♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c29d767647970bbc6a04323c428303fb6fa478db24a28653c258f6c7a8ec9e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bf47ffab8e1bdaae4229ab8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿！去夜间散步兼巡逻吧！\r\n守护学园的和平，\r\n也是cowgirl的使命☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f849d89d265ef855c6c7f438963d793c0682f4047fae789cd778189ef3a5d08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58304aa6b461a903ae11f3bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是一边赏花，\r\n一边唱卡拉OK的季节吧！\r\n我的拿手歌曲要发威了……哟☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d755ab0fb8f348a188da2d77db5e8f750e828abc4ba1dd85a4f22751f10d733d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9c18caf044f5e9c6057874e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗨！\r\n接下来要不要一起BBQ啊？\r\n有冰冰凉凉的大杯牛奶喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1ae65b21476725792862d1e3332e605996eae05984a5d8b24ea59034ec07230",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14eb2a1a2552c9533f11c654",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天赏花，秋天赏枫！\r\n训练员，\r\n一起去看红叶吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b6563b78a06053634b926e38d7885f305baa6312377abb6f9772791b142c738",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:181e0c635626d1a1d6cd3592",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肚子好冷……不过没问题！\r\n因为我刚才吃了\r\n热腾腾的关东煮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4992f7449a2759a8b64bcf728af796e23de72ecde89df10a21bb1932795ba291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1a54fb575ce418c838bced5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy Valentine's!",
      "source_fingerprint": "c686edaa6fd96d36ea792fb6afb501cba57ebda570129810f9f903c7e7bad9f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:575712989f99d78a7951af75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy Valentine's!",
      "source_fingerprint": "c686edaa6fd96d36ea792fb6afb501cba57ebda570129810f9f903c7e7bad9f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a935ad6a164ba90d2506e2bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铃鹿跑得好快Death！\r\n下次我一定要追上她，\r\n然后给她一个紧紧的抱抱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64a99d0e0353095526bf93daf513fa08f43f7367502414f361b31b1a26b0ef92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c666baf97768a000078b91a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次Radio Dance Battle的\r\nWinner当然是我咯！\r\n我是不会输给采珠同学的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2904b5c834e4b290a3b2f9af416714d6ef9e9c70d407e4e506597bc336f7c0ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:889e750622e0c08e3ff2e801",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有Little Sisters\r\n所以也是个姐姐哦！\r\n换句话说……我是很可靠的Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8b7efca22fa8f0c5cad48eae091f37ebb6dbb945b6be41df2793fccca678405",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c797fc4ba5c504efe8e9562",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "关键时刻\r\n我也是会很专注的！\r\n……偷瞄……偷瞄偷瞄。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cfce63b2cbfd3de4e6cda076d815d128f6ed441af581bd432cdc17c7f3bc9b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:488c5f51c2723ce67f401c2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oh……我忘记有功课要做了。\r\n不知道多伯今天晚上\r\n还愿不愿意帮忙……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b4f7399029c32b564cded48af8030c4c6b53ec2587403a4bf4311a2ba3267aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:220d186a242804b9a1aa2f2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝粉丝的Heart……BANG！\r\n想让大家看到我Excellent的跑姿呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "32347742feb65a18fb91a3e2fc471a77d049b714514a4070e07264eb564c44a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a857cb628ed2266f1dbdcd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…Hey。\r\nWell……\r\n再多关心我一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b93f7005e0a4cd1ac8428d485ac37b30f04114f8f97c855541bf6ecec12f3e4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a637706308d5a9d5ac845804",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是Dirt还是Turf都没问题！\r\n我会穿着这双特制的Boots跑到顶点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4763f5b69338a31c9eb47d288f9a46cbfd0842ca74141a797b43dc00b1164088",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b3b6c118ef6af0bee60f4ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，跟我一起看西部剧吧～！！\r\n我保证我不会爆雷的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb20862aabefc0e52fc8b137f2312e825612d1286ead1fe3eea6fa760cb72a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceac881251f97d10531b94f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cock-a-doodle-doo！！\r\n啊哈哈，我在学鸡叫哦！\r\n训练员有醒过来了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "149e5a3eba9de346e0f2f9a01f286cd632bff2a709f44fdac1c3a00f1bb9d909",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39ce8fa8ba1019e160634273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊！？我又忘了还怒涛笔了……\r\n等一下要去说对不起才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95f9650313ca0878d6d45908e578c41bbf62da4b15ccb4ef5638785b9c22b148",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8da53813ba188bf8c63479e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "距离Good Night的时间\r\n还早Death！\r\n……没错吧？对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da646d4f99ebab1b12d8dad720a70bb323de451f8b45782d3d8354ddbe8d6427",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6f3429f04ef3a6b211ce8d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗅嗅……Oh，好多Flower的香气Death。\r\n真不愧是日本的春天啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "305d19dd5090f79ddf5e8854f59ecac9d98a07fa65a2fd461f767410a54de990",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:908a6e45f2777eaa47756d8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Where is My\r\nSummer Vacation！！\r\n课后辅导跟作业太多了Death～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24b211d3956c15eb6c6e557ace3efc8f39c446b2b1363af856d5830b6da7b9f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c7970aeee1b3fe397f0cfd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hmm……\r\n红叶、英里赛、Sweets……\r\n要先从哪个开始享受呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6139316f1637c5a281453c5117313cdb87cbbab34ceed77c5cd7811239967ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aa08310cfb972cfc98ddd90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "猫会在暖炉桌里缩成一团……\r\n我也要在暖炉桌里缩成一团……\r\n呼啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a9cbc0edf63828b6c7db0217fa728e4f0279c1bc91972fb180e370066e1152d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d36c874e7734110e52338d80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……日本人好厉害。\r\n居然能忍受外出排队……\r\n不愧是忍者之国……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e690bc1a511346bfa91dca391ee1822e08584fcd678317854be5f626b193a6c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aca3ae021a2b6b1ad47a3206",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "What！指甲油剥落了！\r\n要去找佐敦帮忙瞧瞧了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e20c16339239dbfae34fc228015e0935c5a6afdd8e26b03aea429bf6f8b5a57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39cce17c636a2c05cd536ea8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我请多伯帮我的头发做造型！\r\n不只变得充满光泽，\r\n还很香呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "21ddd1d58856add87f6d375b4a0aa5a5eadff98c4ccecd7429515bd0b9f83312",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1742b80b819368b0d91c66ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一起去购物吧！\r\n我来帮你挑件最棒的衣服～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a830635225ee49dab8f3e56609a217e855056e989d22f04de2817d5884fb4e29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0feab54becbe75360021f3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乌拉拉的头发，真的好漂亮……\r\n就像樱饼一样……（流口水……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "467d4e95e7028d6deb7dea255bb6ffed7ab8584d59e5b501344ecfe6deb21ec3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a881c66c97053042495081b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果也能穿这样上课，\r\n或许会让课堂变得很开心……！？\r\n我的脑袋从一大早就很灵光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5efe3b1f67b15c1b681d1460e3c0cd9be12efaaf54c11c6fc50da87d93e12ac0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd0dec6ef443e19c8ca91c90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸跟妈妈，现在都在呼呼大睡。\r\n呵呵……好期待\r\n明天能跟他们视讯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "962e89b4a95af999fd9e759932f7a6c5a80ec82612125be0e7c0f43f6e8daff7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56e2dc7327292ae798c6dfbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多到夜宵时间了！\r\n我要吃很多！因为这套服装\r\n不用担心被肚子撑大☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "09e0b31aad6de248831edd103cf3df6e464e969aec04c7b583fbedcd7e388a65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0b567dbc965513467d0300d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「春天的曙光最优美」……！\r\n好期待菱曙做的春季料理！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53a7355e01183d65c44384f0280bd30d496a693e8d3ba1d130215c492df0178c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:359586a4d21ce5dd608e4e6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天的樱花树非常dangerous！\r\n毛毛虫……蚰蜒……会刺痛肌肤！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbbc601fcb8bbe31b67dda5276944f4b5cce8bd8e822491471ffb6d7c23280ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfc56371ca81cec66e8eb8de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃日式馒头的季节到了！\r\n我也很～喜欢玩\r\n挤馒头游戏呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3df26bd637f2579de7ad16a8022d35b8afcabe3a202a2484ce6f113e7c3b41a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:558874225e11780c08b9445f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服看起来很冷……？\r\n但只要抱在一起很快就暖呼呼！\r\n来试试看吧！快点过来♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "52ca951602f9e51d46df90f31c5bbfa627ac9046bf52dfe19ccb6fa1317188ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55768c4929263da7123b5f9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我又拍到有趣的照片了！\r\n我最喜欢的是铃鹿这张……呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c71f9108eb7cd136b19485be3e92d9dbfdf82de6a79019659671ee5b75d92b02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a182c3c6fbb708436a157287",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个手环是美国的朋友\r\n送我的饯别礼！只要看着它……\r\n勇气就会不断地涌出！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cd14f15c747d9b94e6c9be9c405d00b7a125c88ce5d9ecda8be865afe77ae15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4536c9007ac8ae5df7cc651",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "It's a Training Time！\r\n我要Wild的狂奔哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e1fc606ef210a1a70c45bae7b1696038e4fb19de7d953cf6dbbe53bf0f41523",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f47d1322301b606262e9a3e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レッツゴー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "503c9a6175732bd7c6c4ebd2da966ab9ef4985c51ba5f95bbcb3385b5bb57b42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5615a82f246256925cd78aad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Howdy！训练员。\r\n我们要先从什么开始做起呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b90bcfeaea20b291926a0a95c81648f7cd4ed230fe38043370e8ae0756d33edb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b34bb83a4660b6473d175f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在课堂中睡饱饱才来的～！\r\n也就是说呢……\r\n我已经做好训练前的准备了Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "761624eedea5bc5df7e58220e11b290ef71b24170ded45ce1611aaffd3cad2d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67ace58bdee46c84ac84f2dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！\r\n麻烦你像武士道那样指导我了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b638f6ba96eb94bca059f8c201af38032158337a220a0519dc7bbdce268b71e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fa2cb350f935263b398db30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想让Family跟Friends\r\n看看我Live的样子……\r\n所以会努力接受训练的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f444aa4233eb474f5f404f76d0c308331f810402966635e3ae7170f8b9c88a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67d402f74d9f355470d0ccad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这也是为了Get到Center的位置，\r\n所以要继续跟训练员\r\n一起努力训练哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "845c6eb39c2f91c87c817fdc84f16c294052aba11c86ca8cc27d13f08df772c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f573d872355e051678adb9fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要把Happy\r\n一直传送到地平线的另一边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81e7fcafee943f265a2103b88a4be652c7f01fcc1efcb91e38394697e1593531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89ab55f38b0642e626ff2e46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要更Step Up！",
      "source_fingerprint": "955d7851ac6e73af21de83b3efcbbef0607ca7055ced8ee955ab020767b5169e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4073d31c73b0dab731f708ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情very fresh！\r\n看我展现轻快的脚步吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba5de06554206da215be2190e01b048b359b9b332b6fa032c63bb70577a009ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92b22297df88e27e7cd436e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的日子，\r\n也是特别的回忆！\r\n一起拍照留念吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "81224dba5a827fc9925daf0d54887de18bebafb55883f4fb876fda0496c86e67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09e340b3597e48685ed94360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要闭上眼睛就能听见！\r\n爸爸跟妈妈替我加油的声音！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdb941b8c3ab4b003f0a2d3b42fba65c2ad2f208ab01696ce60b4655cd64454",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b2603584d6876f886fd60ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是外出或训练……\r\n都要保持愉快，here we go♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "73b5e37a861695c01c1207247d1f2ebfbd31b4435a7746a955d4d06f5a505333",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b20732f130e276cef357d56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要和训练员在一起，\r\n内心就会暖呼呼的……\r\n像在晒太阳一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f1e2fd68a047d34ccfc173ab05a580da1faf98e6122b9ac70d1f46aa31fdeea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce9eceb3c908fd6e6058bbf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前有朋友跟我说。\r\n我和训练员拍双人合照时，\r\n笑起来最可爱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02b5478fa509b93d91c536495d062a9c84f32236aa463b6648c41fd815a8cc72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7eedcb4dc1bfc464031f558",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次放春假一起去美国吧！\r\n我想带你去逛充满回忆的地方……\r\n爸爸他们一定会很高兴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8761692569b505e78c3f08c37d17197e88e8afb868417141d6988baa9c658a91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:060fbdfad77d811e65af9dcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yes！我就是Perfect的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bec33465577e6d0a39194b0bc8966a2d54ef89486e8e228d58f609c4e654497",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9530793d32a3dbe69b3e0499",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在任何国家我都不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad527e657e83c6cbc99e642dcdea1506163a023597ca3e4b19d94b0a4e6b777c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cda3679a91be9b0ee43c782d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我确实找到了！\r\n只属于我的宝藏♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "92121d37bd82e59b77b89d1c2da725e0e56154dc2606ce07c73e8ce7d982c4ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8413ef8ce8076a28cc42ef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完成了一场充满回忆的冒险！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e02b40f2216db19bc093e268fe4c611bd5a15db99d7076f031a94a775d46ac5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d608b29c1921a98e13caa5b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还可以跑得再更快、更快吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4755a840ea8288f9678812e0a0bc7ec95936738d4d17bc3a614034b2e3c0484b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:561298ea350697a5e0ce717a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还请看着Wonderful的我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad7e181e00e3f1073ea2ebe90e68d436fd9162f39a53b49a79f2f360f417af28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60d4d7b4f30c8319eb427a00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hi！我是大树快车！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdbe7ce4d6566e9ac7b020676a05dcb0d5a99f231fdf74e17539a9d3c517fd0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e18a998e782aa0b914ed1a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "BANG！\r\n把这世界轰出一个大洞吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c7ae5d89c095fe5789eb8020d12507e3aa84315f7ded84d8e7b402869778ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68ca498e3fd28e8f3fd81040",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Support就交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40e254601e2bdfcc7743bc40bad3e119a20d8c59cd9e0528c56c934db4c8ca41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc2086da4e53c3932c1390b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会成为值得大家信赖的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11598ad5d7064985d1b441506409856c98b3475e016ac0239a78d199aa62d8be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e929bf900c1aabc825189d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成长茁壮♪生长期！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64da2a73dbff8b84cba46a92d4f65a3ddbb2097cac6896364a6ddb3d7c79b4e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba10d92cda31035e5f3e7a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Wow！发现新的大树了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "633df7b2a8a755060e612620662705a9cc2acf5208e2d7f902d9030d4a568626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea3f8663081bade150bff4fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啪嚓☆拍到笑容了！\r\nVictory也将由我收下♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e56b804dee8a01e3f7739a9423550889f5ce1f8b4685f7f2c03f9078e28f9f62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b806c4f7200ced940c6cef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是大树快车☆\r\nSay cheese♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "172f8d9d84b8bfd95d777b3ce9d640946bfeb31527d1a8b49d5c56c50775e3fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90233809db8c2ca5517a76b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "072bc1cfc92553e1583c00df8ccb4b3ecd60ff542b56a93421a2b5627a7f9692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40b31e83beae83316f838210",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不屈从也不妥协，这就是我。\r\n能得到您的肯定……我不胜感激。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdec50d690e02fbe95d5f80a3c09bcd893b680246dc675a4c6d448aa8b3f28c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f86252df63757a2adcdd500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってまいります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75133557f59df29494c0938969f36c0c309236de7ceb17ecf7e6c0ce9cb5da09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6d84222b1d1ff1b6cbc50bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま帰りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "481ece6b5ae3f39ab09cef14164dcd64ddd6f960e487ca411576688b02f8f52f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53669ab4ee761512904977e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以赛马娘的顶点为目标的\r\n这条道路……请务必，\r\n陪我走到尽头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "674bdbfbd2fc4448a886831a35bee36c1c5869c3a11d50f259af22355b3c6b81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8e2a0701f23aa816b338a87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "独身前往那里的话，果然还是会\r\n稍稍感到惴惴不安……\r\n能够再陪我去一趟吗？游戏厅♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "675faee325592384f8a4409875b01849c8494d338c655c489a308cf35e3f4287",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10002"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
